          <td align="center">
          <p class="headline">Unseen University Charter</p>
          <p>These are guidelines for guild members. However actions are not limited to just this list.</p>
			<ul>
			<li><p align="left">Play nice and be nice.  The name of Unseen University has a good
			reputation on Norrath, and all members must uphold this reputation at
			all times</p>
			</li>
			<li><p align="left">All members must play the majority of their game time during GMT
  			prime time hours (6pm to 12pm).</p>
		    </li>
		    <li><p align="left">Prospective new members must group with other members for a minimum
			period of 2 weeks.</p>
		    </li>
		    <li><p align="left">New members will be on a one calendar month trial period.</p>
		    </li>
		    <li><p align="left">All characters in the guild, be them primary or secondary characters, must be level 6 or above.</p>
		    <li><p align="left">You can have up to 2 different characters in the guild, not counting level 50+ characters.</p>
		    </li>
		    <li><p align="left">Deliberate Kill Stealing and/or Ninja Looting from *any* other
			Player Character in the game will lead to dismissal from the guild.</p>
		    </li>
		</ul>
          
          
          </td>
